WEBVTT

00:01.584 --> 00:03.294
-Again?
-What's that sound?

00:08.091 --> 00:11.052
While stopping for a break
at the ruins of Utgard Castle...

00:12.929 --> 00:16.057
the Scouts were overwhelmed
by a Titan assault, 

00:16.558 --> 00:17.976
vanquishing their hope of survival.

00:18.393 --> 00:19.894
-Nanaba...
-No!

00:20.228 --> 00:21.438
-And Gelgar...
-No!

00:21.563 --> 00:23.189
Father, stop!

00:23.857 --> 00:25.567
However, at that moment...

00:26.317 --> 00:27.193
Christa.

00:27.819 --> 00:31.322
This is nothing more
than a hope of mine...

00:32.866 --> 00:35.410
I want you to live a life
that you're proud of.

00:37.287 --> 00:39.039
Ymir! Wait!

00:41.124 --> 00:43.501
Ymir suddenly transformed into a Titan.

00:45.628 --> 00:46.880
Keep it up, Ymir!

00:49.340 --> 00:50.633
Do you want to live?

00:50.967 --> 00:52.218
Grab onto me!

00:59.100 --> 01:00.185
This looks bad.

01:02.979 --> 01:04.147
Ymir is...

01:06.608 --> 01:07.734
This can't...

01:08.401 --> 01:10.111
I still haven't told you...

01:11.112 --> 01:12.655
my real name!

01:16.618 --> 01:20.121
Then the main force of the Scouts
rushed in to engage the enemy.

01:20.830 --> 01:21.664
Die!

01:26.294 --> 01:28.963
They successfully countered
the Titan attack.

01:32.509 --> 01:33.343
However,

01:34.135 --> 01:36.054
upon the remains of the battle,

01:36.846 --> 01:39.933
Eren and the others
learn a surprising truth.

01:41.935 --> 01:42.852
Ymir...

01:44.854 --> 01:46.147
My real name is...

01:47.941 --> 01:49.734
Historia.

03:53.316 --> 03:54.150
Slowly!

03:54.901 --> 03:56.110
Bring it up slowly!

03:58.738 --> 04:00.156
Raise it carefully!

04:08.331 --> 04:11.834
What sort of shape is Ymir in?

04:12.877 --> 04:14.671
Her right arm and leg were bitten off,

04:15.380 --> 04:18.132
and her insides were beaten
like scrambled eggs.

04:19.092 --> 04:21.010
If she was a normal person,
she would be dead for sure.

04:24.097 --> 04:26.432
"If she was a normal person"?

04:35.858 --> 04:37.235
Reiner! Grab on!

04:38.027 --> 04:38.861
Right!

04:43.283 --> 04:44.742
Please, believe me!

04:45.243 --> 04:46.244
I'm telling you the truth!

04:46.661 --> 04:48.663
Ymir transformed into a Titan

04:48.871 --> 04:51.124
to fight off the other Titans and save us!

04:52.000 --> 04:54.877
She sacrificed her own life,

04:55.295 --> 04:57.547
which proves her loyalty to us!

04:58.339 --> 05:02.218
It's true that her judgment thus far
has been unforgivable.

05:02.969 --> 05:05.847
After all, she may know things useful
to humanity

05:06.055 --> 05:07.390
and yet she kept quiet about it!

05:08.433 --> 05:12.562
I imagine she didn't say anything
in order to protect herself.

05:13.730 --> 05:15.857
But now, she's a changed person!

05:16.691 --> 05:18.860
Ymir is an ally of humanity!

05:19.402 --> 05:21.237
I know Ymir better than anyone else.

05:21.738 --> 05:24.115
She's a much simpler person
than she looks!

05:26.617 --> 05:27.452
I see.

05:28.661 --> 05:32.123
Of course, I hope we can build
a trusting relationship with her.

05:33.333 --> 05:34.709
Aside from her judgment,

05:35.209 --> 05:38.713
the information that she holds
is a treasure for humanity.

05:39.297 --> 05:40.214
I hope we get along.

05:42.508 --> 05:43.342
But you know...

05:44.552 --> 05:46.304
even if she is a simple person,

05:47.180 --> 05:50.516
this world becomes more
of a confusing mess with each passing day.

05:54.062 --> 05:57.398
You said your real name
was Historia Reiss?

05:58.733 --> 06:00.234
Yes, that's right.

06:00.902 --> 06:03.404
Reiss, like that noble family?

06:05.364 --> 06:06.199
Yes.

06:07.241 --> 06:08.076
I see.

06:12.413 --> 06:14.540
Nice to meet you, Historia.

06:16.626 --> 06:17.502
Yes...

06:22.090 --> 06:23.049
How's Ymir?

06:23.758 --> 06:25.384
She's still in a coma.

06:25.927 --> 06:26.969
Her bleeding has stopped,

06:27.261 --> 06:29.722
and we think steam is
coming out of her wounds.

06:32.350 --> 06:34.852
For now, take her back to Trost

06:35.061 --> 06:36.979
so she can get proper medical care.

06:37.897 --> 06:40.024
-She's in your hands.
-Understood.

06:42.819 --> 06:43.820
Now then...

06:45.404 --> 06:48.533
Our mission was to seal this wall.

07:02.088 --> 07:04.048
Damn, it hurts.

07:05.550 --> 07:06.926
Are you all right, Reiner?

07:07.385 --> 07:08.845
Not at all.

07:10.096 --> 07:12.181
A Titan nearly gnawed off my arm.

07:12.807 --> 07:15.101
That was pathetic.

07:15.935 --> 07:17.145
I thought I was done for.

07:26.154 --> 07:29.365
Things like that can even happen
to someone as strong as you.

07:29.532 --> 07:32.702
What are you talking about?
This is the second time for me!

07:33.077 --> 07:33.953
Tell him, Armin.

07:34.495 --> 07:35.329
What?

07:35.746 --> 07:38.916
Remember when I almost got crushed
in that Titan's hand?

07:40.001 --> 07:40.960
Right...

07:43.880 --> 07:44.922
Back then...

07:45.923 --> 07:48.342
That means I've almost died twice.

07:49.177 --> 07:51.429
At this rate,
I'll be dead before I know it.

07:52.847 --> 07:56.642
I have chosen this path,
but being a soldier is tough.

07:57.894 --> 08:00.521
It's like a soldier's spirit breaks down
before their body.

08:03.024 --> 08:05.776
But until we plug up this wall,

08:06.694 --> 08:08.613
there's no time to waste whining about it.

08:09.572 --> 08:10.406
Yes.

08:11.157 --> 08:14.494
You two have been driven far enough
from your hometown.

08:15.620 --> 08:18.414
I think this is where
we've got to draw the line.

08:21.375 --> 08:22.585
He's right, Reiner!

08:23.544 --> 08:25.213
Let us go back to our hometown!

08:26.047 --> 08:28.090
Isn't it time to go back?

08:28.341 --> 08:30.384
Compared to all the trouble
we've been through,

08:30.593 --> 08:32.053
there's nothing left to do!

08:33.721 --> 08:34.764
That's right.

08:35.223 --> 08:37.808
We're so close,
it's just a few steps until the end.

08:38.726 --> 08:39.560
What?

08:40.895 --> 08:43.105
What are you guys talking about?

08:48.444 --> 08:49.820
Thanks, Mikasa.

08:50.279 --> 08:51.280
Are you hurt?

08:51.781 --> 08:54.825
I'm fine, but Reiner got his arm bit

08:55.284 --> 08:57.078
and Ymir is... as you can see.

08:58.412 --> 09:01.040
Who would've thought Ymir was a Titan too?

09:01.874 --> 09:02.917
-Does that--
-Sasha.

09:04.585 --> 09:05.670
Is everyone okay?

09:06.212 --> 09:08.089
We'll deal with Ymir later.

09:08.798 --> 09:09.715
And Conny...

09:10.758 --> 09:14.095
Later, I'll arrange for a Scout squad
to investigate your village.

09:14.470 --> 09:15.513
For the time being,

09:15.972 --> 09:18.182
I want you to focus on the mission
to fix the wall.

09:18.891 --> 09:20.268
-Got it?
-Got it!

09:21.978 --> 09:26.232
Still, I'm expecting Titans
to swarm this place.

09:29.819 --> 09:30.736
Hannes?

09:31.612 --> 09:33.531
It's the Garrison's advance squad.

09:34.198 --> 09:35.950
They've come to tell us where the hole is.

09:43.833 --> 09:45.209
There's no hole anywhere!

09:46.419 --> 09:49.338
-What?
-We spent all night looking for it,

09:50.089 --> 09:52.925
but there's nothing wrong with the wall,

09:53.301 --> 09:54.802
at least between Trost
and Krolva District.

09:55.177 --> 09:56.137
What did you say?

09:57.138 --> 10:00.099
We bumped into soldiers from Krolva
and retraced our steps.

10:01.183 --> 10:03.686
We haven't seen any Titans
on the way here.

10:04.312 --> 10:08.316
But we know for sure there are Titans
on this side of the wall.

10:08.649 --> 10:11.986
Did you actually look?
Are you sure you're not drunk?

10:12.194 --> 10:13.070
I didn't drink!

10:13.487 --> 10:15.990
Wait, why are you all here anyway?

10:27.084 --> 10:29.211
If there's no hole in the wall,
then so be it.

10:30.212 --> 10:32.340
For now, we're going back
to Trost District!

10:38.262 --> 10:40.306
Whatever you do,
don't let your guard down.

10:42.516 --> 10:43.934
We're going back ahead of you.

10:49.315 --> 10:51.233
"There's nothing wrong with the wall"?

10:52.109 --> 10:53.402
What does that mean?

10:54.612 --> 10:56.447
There's been nothing like this
in five years.

10:56.781 --> 10:58.532
Why is it all happening now?

10:58.991 --> 11:01.786
This world is getting more and more
out of hand.

11:01.952 --> 11:02.787
Eren.

11:04.288 --> 11:06.624
Got a minute? We need to talk.

11:08.376 --> 11:09.210
What about?

11:11.003 --> 11:12.421
Five years ago,

11:13.047 --> 11:15.716
we demolished the wall
and began our attack on humanity.

11:16.092 --> 11:16.926
Oh, no!

11:17.134 --> 11:20.471
What if there's a Titan who dug a hole
underneath the wall?

11:20.805 --> 11:23.432
In that case,
the hole will be hard to find.

11:23.516 --> 11:26.894
I'm the Armored Titan
and he's the Colossal Titan.

11:26.977 --> 11:30.773
Right now, we need to focus
on getting Ymir back safely.

11:31.107 --> 11:33.651
Even with our horses,
we still have to worry about Titans.

11:34.985 --> 11:35.861
What?

11:36.529 --> 11:37.822
What are you talking about?

11:37.947 --> 11:40.074
Why are you telling him, Reiner?

11:40.241 --> 11:44.662
Our primary goal was to ensure
that all of humanity was wiped out...

11:45.621 --> 11:48.165
but now there's no need for that.

11:48.624 --> 11:50.042
-What?
-Eren.

11:50.709 --> 11:52.837
If you agree to come with us,

11:53.379 --> 11:55.840
we won't have to destroy
any more of the walls.

11:57.550 --> 11:59.343
-Understand?
-What?

11:59.802 --> 12:02.430
No, wait! I don't understand at all!

12:02.721 --> 12:03.597
I'm saying...

12:03.806 --> 12:06.058
Why don't you just come with us?

12:14.567 --> 12:16.944
I know this is sudden,
but we need to go now.

12:17.695 --> 12:19.989
Right now? Where will you take me?

12:20.573 --> 12:21.615
I can't say that yet.

12:22.575 --> 12:23.617
But...

12:24.034 --> 12:26.704
Well, it's something like our hometown.

12:27.621 --> 12:30.499
-So? What will it be, Eren?
-What?

12:30.791 --> 12:32.293
It's not a bad deal, right?

12:32.835 --> 12:34.628
You can easily avoid this crisis.

12:37.089 --> 12:38.382
I wonder about that...

12:39.717 --> 12:41.886
Hey! We're leaving!

12:47.933 --> 12:49.685
What the hell?

12:50.352 --> 12:53.731
And here I thought I had enough
to think about yesterday...

13:00.571 --> 13:02.531
12 HOURS EARLIER

13:02.656 --> 13:03.491
Eren?

13:04.325 --> 13:05.784
What is it, Section Commander?

13:07.953 --> 13:08.787
Oh, well...

13:09.079 --> 13:10.456
I was finally able to get my hands

13:10.581 --> 13:14.335
on the background report
for Annie Leonhart.

13:16.212 --> 13:17.713
-Annie's?
-Yes.

13:18.589 --> 13:20.424
It's taken so long to get it

13:20.716 --> 13:23.260
because managing these reports
is a mess right now.

13:23.969 --> 13:24.803
According to this,

13:25.679 --> 13:28.224
there were two others
in the 104th Cadet Corps

13:28.557 --> 13:31.477
who came from the same area as her.

13:34.146 --> 13:35.397
And those two are...

13:36.398 --> 13:39.527
Reiner Braun and Bertholdt Hoover.

13:47.326 --> 13:49.203
Thanks to the chaos five years ago,

13:49.912 --> 13:53.749
much of their family records are missing.

13:54.458 --> 13:55.292
However...

13:56.377 --> 13:58.629
During the long-range scouting formation,

13:59.129 --> 14:01.340
their unit was given
the wrong information.

14:01.840 --> 14:06.053
They were among those purposely told
that Eren was on the right-wing.

14:09.014 --> 14:11.809
The Female Titan attacked
from the right-wing!

14:12.017 --> 14:14.061
What? What does that mean?

14:14.270 --> 14:18.274
It's possible they passed on
that information to Annie...

14:18.524 --> 14:20.234
Why? Why would they tell Annie?

14:20.568 --> 14:22.194
Hey, hold on a minute, Armin.

14:22.361 --> 14:24.488
-You can't just--
-I know that, Eren.

14:25.030 --> 14:27.533
But that's not enough
to prove anything by itself.

14:29.451 --> 14:31.537
So just in case, I want to hear from you

14:31.620 --> 14:33.789
how these three interacted
during training.

14:34.290 --> 14:35.124
Do you know anything?

14:37.084 --> 14:39.920
I knew Reiner and Bertholdt
were from the same place,

14:40.629 --> 14:42.256
but they didn't seem close to Annie.

14:43.424 --> 14:44.341
I agree.

14:44.592 --> 14:48.470
I don't recall ever seeing the pair
talking to Annie that much.

14:49.388 --> 14:52.433
Well, Annie didn't talk that much
in the first place.

14:53.183 --> 14:57.563
When we ate, Annie would always sit alone
and eat by herself.

14:58.314 --> 15:00.024
Oh, I've got something!

15:00.357 --> 15:03.944
I heard a rumor that she likes sweets,
even though she looks so grumpy!

15:04.904 --> 15:05.738
I...

15:06.989 --> 15:07.990
don't remember.

15:08.449 --> 15:10.993
But as their comrade,

15:11.368 --> 15:13.162
I would find it hard to believe.

15:13.913 --> 15:15.789
Well, Bertholdt doesn't say much.

15:16.248 --> 15:18.250
Reiner is like everyone's big brother,

15:18.626 --> 15:21.128
and he's not devious enough
to deceive us all.

15:22.588 --> 15:24.006
I agree.

15:24.798 --> 15:28.260
Reiner gave everything he had
to fight the Female Titan.

15:28.844 --> 15:31.764
He would have gotten crushed
in her hand, if he hadn't...

15:33.682 --> 15:34.516
What's wrong?

15:35.851 --> 15:37.978
Reiner managed to escape...

15:39.188 --> 15:44.485
but Annie suddenly changed her course
and ran to Eren's direction.

15:46.070 --> 15:46.904
I...

15:47.696 --> 15:51.742
did mention that Eren might be
at the rear of the center group.

15:52.284 --> 15:55.621
-But Annie was too far away to hear...
-Seriously?

15:57.665 --> 16:01.293
Did Reiner seem overly interested
in Eren's location?

16:05.339 --> 16:08.217
So, where the hell is Eren?

16:10.344 --> 16:11.303
It can't be...

16:15.599 --> 16:17.643
I only started talking
about Eren's position...

16:18.936 --> 16:21.230
because Reiner was the one
who asked about it.

16:23.399 --> 16:24.441
Furthermore...

16:25.401 --> 16:29.321
after that happened,
the Female Titan stared at her palm.

16:29.613 --> 16:32.574
He might have written a message
in her hand using his blades.

16:34.868 --> 16:35.869
Reiner could've...

16:45.379 --> 16:46.588
What the hell?

16:47.339 --> 16:49.466
Why are you saying things like this?

16:49.883 --> 16:50.968
-You--
-Eren!

16:52.428 --> 16:54.179
No. Everyone, listen up!

16:54.972 --> 16:57.099
Should we find Reiner or Bertholdt,

16:57.433 --> 16:59.810
act in a way that doesn't seem suspicious.

17:00.811 --> 17:04.648
Of course,
don't mention Annie Leonhart either.

17:05.315 --> 17:07.776
Regardless of whether
they're Annie's accomplices or not,

17:08.360 --> 17:11.321
we need to lead them deep underground
and confine them.

17:12.364 --> 17:14.575
-Does everyone understand?
-Yes!

17:24.501 --> 17:26.670
You're just tired, aren't you?

17:27.671 --> 17:28.714
Right, Bertholdt?

17:29.465 --> 17:31.925
You've been through so much,
it's making you crazy.

17:32.509 --> 17:33.969
Yes.

17:34.428 --> 17:36.180
Reiner's just really tired.

17:37.181 --> 17:38.223
Besides,

17:38.640 --> 17:41.560
if you were really the Armored Titan
that wants to destroy humanity,

17:42.436 --> 17:44.688
why would you be asking me this
to begin with?

17:46.148 --> 17:47.316
What did you think would happen?

17:47.649 --> 17:50.611
That I would nod and say,
"Sure, let's go"?

18:02.539 --> 18:03.624
Oh, right.

18:04.792 --> 18:05.959
That's right.

18:07.503 --> 18:09.129
What the hell was I thinking?

18:11.632 --> 18:13.509
Have I really gone crazy?

18:17.304 --> 18:18.388
Come on, let's go.

18:50.170 --> 18:51.088
I see...

18:53.132 --> 18:54.091
That's it.

18:56.218 --> 18:58.762
I've been here too long for my own good.

19:01.390 --> 19:03.142
It's been three long years...

19:04.268 --> 19:05.936
surrounded by nothing but idiots.

19:07.479 --> 19:08.689
We were just kids...

19:09.314 --> 19:10.941
We didn't know anything.

19:13.527 --> 19:16.321
If only I never knew that
there were people like this...

19:17.823 --> 19:18.740
I...

19:20.450 --> 19:22.035
wouldn't have become...

19:23.162 --> 19:25.455
such a half-assed piece of shit!

19:28.208 --> 19:32.045
It's too late now.
I don't know what's right anymore.

19:33.046 --> 19:35.674
But the only choice for me now...

19:36.466 --> 19:38.802
is to face the consequences
of my actions...

19:40.929 --> 19:42.139
and as a warrior...

19:43.307 --> 19:45.767
fulfill my duty to the bitter end!

19:51.523 --> 19:53.400
Reiner, are we doing it?

19:53.775 --> 19:56.028
-Now? Right here?
-Yes.

19:56.862 --> 19:59.489
We settle this right here, right now!

20:12.711 --> 20:14.671
Eren! Run!

20:18.175 --> 20:19.092
Bertholdt!

20:25.349 --> 20:27.392
Eren! Get out of there!

21:07.266 --> 21:08.558
Ymir!

21:12.771 --> 21:13.647
Eren!

21:27.828 --> 21:29.705
I'm going to return
to the hometown we lost.

21:30.622 --> 21:33.333
That's all I care about now.

21:40.549 --> 21:41.591
Bertholdt...

21:43.010 --> 21:44.094
Reiner...

21:49.182 --> 21:53.812
You damn traitors!

23:31.785 --> 23:33.370
The Colossal Titan...

23:34.412 --> 23:38.291
as well as the Armored Titan,
engage the Scouts in battle.

23:39.584 --> 23:44.005
If their mission
is to exterminate humanity,

23:44.756 --> 23:47.259
there is no turning back for them now.

23:48.635 --> 23:51.596
Reiner and the others devote their lives
to the mission

23:52.472 --> 23:54.057
because they are warriors.

23:55.684 --> 23:59.312
Next episode, "Close Combat."
